        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "有些 + gradable predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "有些 before an adjective means somewhat, often describing an unwelcome degree. Distinguish this from 有些 + noun meaning some members.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我有些累。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ yǒuxiē lèi 。",
                "meaning": "I am somewhat tired.",
                "audio": "adc70bc890e105b724418686b64c7ca416322291b73ca9810b95121f30a62cec"
              },
              {
                "text": "这本书有些难。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū yǒuxiē nán 。",
                "meaning": "This book is somewhat difficult.",
                "audio": "86811ac498d719d7b6aa10d76584461d1cd454232aaabf21b447e9483bffc770"
